      "writtenOn": "2022-02-05T01:15:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wrote this change and realized it was likely a pessimization, so I don\u0027t think we should do it. Existing callers use pass-by-move or pass in temporaries, and sometimes the API returns the string unchanged (which would require a copy if a const\u0026 is passed in).",
